17080,c0d98b35714fb707217c9062b6518e158cd72eea,CVE-2018-10471,2018.0,CWE-787,Data Protection,"x86/vtx: Introduce a typed union for CR access exit information

This reduces code volume, and has a minor improvement on compiled size,
